## Test-authored bounded fixture preserving the original Chat count operand and arithmetic.
app CountSources
Given
 Conversation {title:text}
 Branch in Conversation {title:text}
 Turn in Branch {position:int min=1}
 policy Conversation read=members
 policy Branch read=members
 policy Turn read=members
When
 scenario append(branch:Branch) by=members -> Turn
  do
   create Turn {parent=branch,position=count(branch.Turn)+1} as turn
   return turn
Then
